  "goodToKnow": "Verdächtig means suspicious: Das kommt mir verdächtig vor (That seems suspicious to me). Sich verdächtig machen means to arouse suspicion. Der/die Verdächtige is a suspect. Tatverdächtig means suspected of a crime. From der Verdacht. On trains and at airports, announcements ask you to report verdächtige Gegenstände (suspicious objects)."
